    <string name="j1_guide_safety_glass_two">当热床升温至 40℃ 以上时，避免直接触碰 PEI 玻璃平台和热床。</string>

    <string name="j1_guide_install_fan_instructions_intro_title">加固模型冷却风扇</string>
    <string name="j1_guide_install_fan_instructions_intro_content">点击<b>去安装</b>，安装螺丝以进一步固定模型冷却风扇。
若已安装螺丝或未购买模型冷却升级组件，请点击<b>跳过</b>。</string>
    <string name="j1_guide_install_fan_instructions_intro_go_to_install">去安装</string>
    <string name="j1_guide_install_fan_instructions_install_screws_title">安装螺丝</string>
    <string name="j1_guide_install_fan_instructions_install_screws_step1">1. 使用粉色 H2.0 L 型扳手，将两颗 M3 ×10 螺丝安装至图示位置。</string>
    <string name="j1_guide_install_fan_instructions_install_screws_step2">2. 点击<b>下一步</b>。</string>
    <string name="j1_guide_install_fan_instructions_install_screws_note"><b>注意</b>：电机已暂时断电。</string>
    <string name="j1_guide_install_fan_instructions_prepare_for_homing_title">准备返回原位</string>
    <string name="j1_guide_install_fan_instructions_prepare_for_homing_content">
        1. 清理机器内的外部物品，并使身体与机器保持一定距离。
        \n2. 点击<b>下一步</b>。机器将开始返回原位。
    </string>
